menu "Portable anti-windup"
config ANTI_WINDUP_IRAM
    bool "Place periodic anti-windup calculation in IRAM"
    default y
    help
        Places only anti_windup_compute in instruction RAM, consuming internal
        instruction memory. Initialization remains in flash. The caller, data,
        stack and full call graph still need auditing for cache-off execution;
        this option does not guarantee timing or scheduler availability.
endmenu
